ing stages saw the tempo slow down with a series of strategic substitutions from both managers. Despite a late yellow card for Benjamin Woodburn in stoppage time, the outcome was never in doubt, and the referee blew the final whistle after nine minutes of added time to confirm a commanding victory for Notts County ."
